<title>USA: Hawaiian Airlines Feb load factor falls.</title>
<headline>Hawaiian Airlines Feb load factor falls.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hawaiian Airlines Wednesday said its systemwide load factor fell to 66.8 percent in February from 77.2 percent a year ago.</p>
</text>
